  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/master/.github/README-assets/icon.png\" width=\"150\"><br></p><h1>实体纹理特性</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><h1>关于</h1><p>ETF 是一款适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 NeoForge 的模组，增加了许多<em>实体纹理特性</em>，包括实体和玩家皮肤特性！</p><p>ETF 主要支持 OptiFine 格式，作为 OptiFine 的替代模组之一，但拥有更多功能和选项！</p><p>如果你想在 Fabric 上获得更多 OptiFine 特性，可以查看由 LambdaAurora 整理的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flambdaurora.dev%252foptifine_alternatives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此列表</a>，<strong>或者</strong>使用包含<strong>所有</strong> OptiFine 兼容模组的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252ffabulously-optimized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabulously Optimized 整合包</a>。</p><h1>特性</h1><ul>\n<li>使用 OptiFine 格式的自定义和随机实体纹理，甚至包含更多属性！<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/RANDOM_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>使用 OptiFine 格式的发光/发光实体纹理。<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/EMISSIVE_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>生物眨眼的简单格式。<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README.md#-blinking-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>玩家皮肤特性，包括眨眼、发光纹理等！<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/SKIN_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n</ul><h1>兼容性</h1><ul>\n<li>OptiFine 的随机/自定义或发光实体资源包</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体模型特性 (EMF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">dorianpb 的旧版 CEM 模组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders</a>（支持程度根据着色器而异）</li>\n<li>模组添加的实体（仅当模组创建者使用原版渲染代码渲染其生物时）</li>\n<li>以及更多</li>\n</ul><h1>设置与配置</h1><p>可通过游戏内<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组菜单</a>、资源包界面中的设置按钮修改设置，或编辑位于 <code>config/entity_texture_features.json</code> 的配置文件。</p><h1>模组支持</h1><p>此模组应兼容任何使用常规原版渲染方式的模组添加的实体。</p><p>在自定义GUI中显示实体的任何模组，可以通过将 <code>entity.getblockstate</code> 设置为 <code>null</code> 或 <code>VOID_AIR</code> 类型来强制使用默认纹理，同样也可以通过将显示实体的UUID设置为 <code>UUID.nameUUIDFromBytes((\"GENERIC\").getBytes())</code> 来实现。</p><hr><h1>更新日志</h1><p>您可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/common/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>查看更新日志。</p><hr><h1>需要帮助或有疑问？</h1><p>您可以联系我的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>（<em>优先推荐</em>）或在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>上提交问题。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><h2>托管合作商优惠</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"image\"></a></p>",
